# Build context for the pvc image (PVC-130). Allow-list style: ignore everything, then re-include
# only what the Dockerfile copies. Keeps secrets, local state and VCS metadata out of the context.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!tests/fixtures/companies/
!infra/docker/healthcheck.py
!infra/docker/bootstrap_db.py

# Never ship caches or local artefacts even inside re-included directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
